WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:01.840
Even if there are spies

00:02.520 --> 00:04.853
We can't investigate everyone one by one

00:05.560 --> 00:07.560
Our brothers below are rough men

00:07.880 --> 00:09.280
Can't stand being suspected

00:09.560 --> 00:10.400
And

00:10.480 --> 00:11.880
Your Highness previously promised

00:12.040 --> 00:12.840
Tonight

00:12.920 --> 00:14.400
To enter in groups

00:20.920 --> 00:22.320
I have a solution
